WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:03.230
There's nothing to be afraid of now!

00:03.230 --> 00:05.400
We have gained power!

00:05.400 --> 00:08.870
We haven't yet decided to fight the Zymot Army.

00:08.870 --> 00:12.370
Kemp merely doesn't know how to fight.

00:12.370 --> 00:16.670
I have been reborn as a warrior,
to eradicate your army!

00:20.950 --> 00:23.580
Just you wait, Hugh.

00:24.820 --> 00:32.560
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:32.560 --> 00:39.520
Towards a far, faraway place

00:52.880 --> 00:59.090
Blown by the wind, we walk on

00:59.090 --> 01:06.050
Wanting to know the reason we were born

01:06.260 --> 01:12.570
Even if a time of loss should come

01:12.570 --> 01:19.700
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

01:22.140 --> 01:29.550
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:29.550 --> 01:35.520
Towards something we can't lose

01:35.520 --> 01:43.160
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:43.160 --> 01:50.040
Towards a far, faraway place

01:58.080 --> 02:01.540
Episode 17
A Wish Unfulfilled

02:19.600 --> 02:22.070
Th..They're here!

02:28.480 --> 02:30.440
They're here!

02:35.450 --> 02:38.950
The Zymot Army has invaded,
and there are a lot of them!

02:38.950 --> 02:40.920
All right, engage the enemy!

02:41.990 --> 02:43.060
Wait!

02:43.060 --> 02:44.230
We mustn't fight them.

02:44.230 --> 02:47.200
Kemp! You're still saying that?!

02:47.200 --> 02:49.820
There's no room for negotiation
with them anymore!

02:50.630 --> 02:52.830
Battle won't gain us a thing.

02:52.830 --> 02:55.840
If we fight, there are sure to be
massive casualties!

02:55.840 --> 02:57.960
I can't quietly sit back and let that happen.

02:58.840 --> 03:00.940
Lay down your weapons, Guzma.

03:00.940 --> 03:02.740
Why should I?!

03:05.550 --> 03:10.520
Kemp, I understand very well the
heavy pressure and responsibility

03:10.520 --> 03:12.390
that come with leading a people.

03:12.390 --> 03:14.760
While they are battling,

03:14.760 --> 03:16.790
I shall protect the people of Kalb-Hu.

03:16.790 --> 03:18.290
Princess Rebecca...

03:18.290 --> 03:20.730
Zed, let's go.

03:20.730 --> 03:22.360
Right...

03:38.150 --> 03:39.950
There are so many of them...

03:39.950 --> 03:43.080
How can just three of us do this?

03:43.750 --> 03:45.550
I'm counting on you.

03:47.660 --> 03:49.450
Princess Rebecca!

03:51.730 --> 03:53.660
This is our battle.

03:53.660 --> 03:56.000
Let us fight with you.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.620
Okay...

03:59.700 --> 04:01.170
Lord Kemp!

04:01.170 --> 04:03.840
You get the villagers to a safe place.

04:03.840 --> 04:05.870
What about you?

04:05.870 --> 04:08.340
I'll stop the fight.

04:23.160 --> 04:27.120
If you don't fight more seriously,
you'll be wiped out in no time.

04:33.130 --> 04:35.260
So, you've shown yourself.

04:40.740 --> 04:42.040
Stop this!

04:42.040 --> 04:44.010
If we stop now, we may still be able to talk...

04:44.950 --> 04:47.070
Hey! Are you all right?

04:48.320 --> 04:51.770
Lord Kemp, I apologize.

04:53.190 --> 04:55.490
Pl..Please protect everyone...

04:56.920 --> 04:59.490
Hey! Stay with me!

04:59.490 --> 05:01.120
Hey!

05:19.810 --> 05:21.980
Thanks, Zed.

05:21.980 --> 05:23.380
Isn't there some other way to do this?

05:23.380 --> 05:24.720
At this rate...

05:24.720 --> 05:26.050
Yeah...

05:26.050 --> 05:29.350
If only we had prepared ourselves
for battle sooner...

05:30.360 --> 05:32.590
We have no chance of winning without
an organized strategy.

05:32.590 --> 05:35.130
We should regroup.

05:35.130 --> 05:37.030
Agreed.

05:37.030 --> 05:38.730
Zed, I leave Princess Rebecca to you.

05:38.730 --> 05:40.300
I'll check on the villagers.

05:40.300 --> 05:41.930
Right!

05:50.240 --> 05:52.680
First those rebels, and now the Kalb-Hu?

05:52.680 --> 05:54.880
Quite the persistent one, aren't you?

05:54.880 --> 05:57.350
Where is Hugh? I know he's here!

05:57.350 --> 05:59.150
No idea!

05:59.490 --> 06:01.280
I'll kill you!

06:06.290 --> 06:08.090
It's over!

06:09.630 --> 06:11.300
Rebecca!

06:11.300 --> 06:12.370
Are you okay?

06:12.370 --> 06:14.070
Yes!

06:14.070 --> 06:17.200
Wh..Who are you?!

06:19.840 --> 06:22.480
That red coat and white hair...

06:22.480 --> 06:26.780
I see, so you're the one who took down Glaudio?

06:36.790 --> 06:38.290
You bitch!

06:38.290 --> 06:41.030
How dare you damage my face?!

06:41.030 --> 06:42.700
Lady Elmeida!

06:42.700 --> 06:44.100
We have orders to withdraw.

06:44.100 --> 06:46.100
Like hell I can do that in this situation!

06:46.100 --> 06:47.900
But King Hugh...

06:54.610 --> 06:57.180
You just say your prayers.

06:57.180 --> 06:59.980
Next time, I'll kill you for sure!

07:06.550 --> 07:08.520
We're saved for now, huh?

07:10.060 --> 07:11.860
What was that for?!

07:11.860 --> 07:14.060
Why do you not use Amir Gaul?

07:14.060 --> 07:16.000
With Amir Gaul's power,

07:16.000 --> 07:18.300
they would not have gotten away with so much.

07:19.700 --> 07:24.110
I still can't use him, Amir Gaul, very well.

07:24.110 --> 07:25.910
What?

07:25.910 --> 07:29.370
Then, give Amir Gaul to me, right now.

07:29.940 --> 07:31.480
Rebecca...

07:31.480 --> 07:33.850
I need power.

07:33.850 --> 07:37.080
I need crushing power to defeat Hugh!

07:37.080 --> 07:40.050
What's happened to you?

07:41.060 --> 07:43.460
Princess Rebecca!

07:43.460 --> 07:45.260
Are you safe?

07:45.960 --> 07:47.760
Princess Rebecca?

07:53.570 --> 07:54.740
Why did you stop me?!

07:54.740 --> 07:57.910
I could have taken Kalb-Hu in one fell swoop!

07:57.910 --> 08:01.910
And that woman cut my face, you know!

08:01.910 --> 08:04.850
I have a plan or two of my own.

08:04.850 --> 08:07.350
You just quietly follow my orders.

08:07.350 --> 08:09.980
I don't remember becoming your servant!

08:17.530 --> 08:19.930
What's the matter, Elmeida?

08:19.930 --> 08:22.600
You shouldn't keep your complaints to yourself.

08:22.600 --> 08:24.670
If you have things you want to say,
get them all off your chest now,

08:24.670 --> 08:28.070
but you will follow my orders.

08:28.070 --> 08:29.800
I know...

08:29.800 --> 08:31.770
Next time, I will come along.

08:31.770 --> 08:33.740
That sounds promising.

08:34.180 --> 08:39.880
If the new king himself is going to battle,
we shall accompany him as well.

08:39.880 --> 08:42.280
Lady Despara...

08:42.280 --> 08:47.120
The battle will not be worthy of the Tuskan
goodwill ambassador's observation.

08:47.120 --> 08:51.750
That would render my return
to Zymot meaningless.

08:52.160 --> 08:56.730
I would by all means love to witness your skill,

08:56.730 --> 09:00.170
which I missed the opportunity
to see during the revolt.

09:00.170 --> 09:05.130
Lady Despara, if that is your aim,
please do as you like.

09:07.940 --> 09:12.010
Here is the result of taking up arms and fighting:

09:12.010 --> 09:14.140
Many people wounded...

09:15.880 --> 09:18.850
...and many precious lives lost.

09:20.420 --> 09:22.490
What should we do now?

09:22.490 --> 09:23.930
We'll just have to fight!

09:23.930 --> 09:26.390
They will come attack us again in no time!

09:27.330 --> 09:28.730
We need to shore up our defenses,

09:28.730 --> 09:32.670
and in the meantime launch a concentrated
attack on their commander.

09:32.670 --> 09:35.000
If we do that, we can definitely win.

09:35.000 --> 09:38.960
Happily, we also have a powerful ally in Zed.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.970
I'm counting on you, Zed.

09:47.750 --> 09:50.590
Is there really no other way but battle?

09:50.590 --> 09:52.220
You're still saying that?!

09:52.220 --> 09:54.990
Do you want us to just quietly
let ourselves be killed?!

09:54.990 --> 10:00.190
No, I'm asking if there's no way
to keep everyone alive;

10:00.190 --> 10:04.150
a way for us to live peacefully
without anyone getting hurt.

10:05.830 --> 10:10.630
As the clan leader, it is my job to guide
the people down that path!

10:11.640 --> 10:14.770
If we unconditionally surrender,
we may still have a chance.

10:15.210 --> 10:17.710
Just stop, already!

10:17.710 --> 10:20.650
Our ancestors had their surface
land stolen from them,

10:20.650 --> 10:22.950
and were chased into the dim underground!

10:22.950 --> 10:26.490
Are you telling us to go through the
same suffering, Kemp?!

10:26.490 --> 10:31.620
But we have many soon-to-be-born
lives that we must protect!

10:32.360 --> 10:34.330
All the more reason to fight.

10:34.330 --> 10:37.790
Our children need a different future than ours!

10:38.570 --> 10:40.230
I will fight.

10:40.230 --> 10:44.510
For the one I love, and for the sake
of our unborn children!

10:44.510 --> 10:48.130
I'll win back a world of sunlight for the Kalb-Hu!

10:55.550 --> 10:57.790
Hey, Zed...

10:57.790 --> 11:01.080
Who do you think is right, Guzma or Kemp?

11:06.490 --> 11:10.160
I wonder what we should do?

11:10.160 --> 11:13.330
I wonder what we can do for them?

11:13.330 --> 11:16.940
As it is, the villagers' opinions are divided.

11:16.940 --> 11:18.910
At this rate, they have no chance.

11:20.270 --> 11:24.070
Why would Zymot come after
a closed-off land like this?

11:25.680 --> 11:30.310
I wonder how it feels to live
in a world with no sky?

11:33.850 --> 11:36.150
It's suffocating, that's all.

11:57.780 --> 12:01.120
She's become much more cheerful, hasn't she?

12:01.120 --> 12:04.080
I can hardly believe she was
so downcast before.

12:04.850 --> 12:07.320
Yes, you're right.

12:09.860 --> 12:13.490
Sagiri doesn't know the truth.

12:14.530 --> 12:18.660
That's why she still smiles that same smile at me.

12:23.340 --> 12:27.470
If Sagiri knew the truth, she would...

12:48.230 --> 12:51.600
No matter how many times you ask me,
my answer will remain the same.

12:51.600 --> 12:56.060
You insist that you cannot aid Neotopia?

13:01.510 --> 13:03.640
After all, this country...

13:22.960 --> 13:26.090
It appears we have unintentionally
caused you pain.

13:26.730 --> 13:30.340
I cannot possibly be of use to anyone.

13:30.340 --> 13:34.640
The only power I have is the
power to hurt people.

13:35.440 --> 13:38.410
This power is something I...

13:39.110 --> 13:42.350
Please remember this one thing:

13:42.350 --> 13:46.990
you came to our world to save Neotopia.

13:46.990 --> 13:49.110
That is your fate.

14:07.880 --> 14:09.410
Rebecca...

14:09.410 --> 14:15.210
You're not using the Kalb-Hu as tools
for your own revenge, are you?

14:16.580 --> 14:19.290
What if I am?

14:19.290 --> 14:20.890
What's wrong with that?

14:20.890 --> 14:22.090
Don't give me that crap!

14:22.090 --> 14:24.060
They trust you...

14:24.060 --> 14:25.860
Quiet!

14:30.760 --> 14:32.390
You two...

14:33.800 --> 14:37.100
You two could never possibly
understand how I feel.

14:38.870 --> 14:45.680
True, I don't think your anger and pain are
things we could easily understand.

14:46.350 --> 14:49.980
But it's still not okay to hurt the people
around you because of them, is it?!

15:01.830 --> 15:04.200
Everything is Hugh's fault.

15:04.200 --> 15:06.170
If it weren't for him...

15:11.410 --> 15:16.040
I pray you, please protect us and the
children coming into this world.

15:17.310 --> 15:19.850
What good is prayer going to do now?

15:19.850 --> 15:23.150
Please grant us peaceful lives,
with no desire for war.

15:24.420 --> 15:26.890
That is what we Kalb-Hu pride ourselves on.

15:26.890 --> 15:29.420
God will watch over us if we remain true to it.

15:29.420 --> 15:32.390
Then, we just have to throw away our
pride and go against God.

15:32.390 --> 15:34.690
To win freedom!

15:50.580 --> 15:53.050
Noah, you must escape, quickly!

15:54.110 --> 15:55.620
It's the resistance fighters!

15:55.620 --> 15:57.550
They mean to take over this hospital!

15:57.550 --> 15:59.050
We're in danger here.

15:59.050 --> 16:00.650
Quickly, let's run away!

16:00.650 --> 16:01.860
Where's Sagiri?

16:01.860 --> 16:03.820
She's with the other staff.

16:08.960 --> 16:10.060
Follow them!

16:10.060 --> 16:12.030
Leave no one alive!

16:20.040 --> 16:22.340
Sorry, but your life ends here.

16:43.900 --> 16:45.520
Get him!

16:53.570 --> 16:54.580
Die!

16:54.580 --> 16:56.200
Stop!

17:01.950 --> 17:03.680
What's wrong, kid?

17:03.680 --> 17:07.120
Don't have the will to resist, even though
you can command shards?

17:07.120 --> 17:08.750
Then die!

17:11.630 --> 17:13.990
Noah, are you all right?

17:13.990 --> 17:16.120
Uh oh, retreat!

17:17.060 --> 17:19.030
Don't let them escape! After them!

17:23.770 --> 17:25.400
Why...

17:26.070 --> 17:29.040
Why would you shield someone like me?!

17:30.110 --> 17:34.070
Because protecting you was their job.

17:34.820 --> 17:39.690
B..But that doesn't mean they should...

17:39.690 --> 17:43.320
Absolute Law can bring out such strong actions

17:43.320 --> 17:45.950
even from those who are powerless.

17:46.990 --> 17:49.430
Absolute Law?

17:49.430 --> 17:52.770
Why did you not use your power?

17:52.770 --> 17:56.400
If you had, you could have saved them.

17:57.500 --> 18:00.800
No! I mustn't use that!

18:01.680 --> 18:04.710
Your power is not at fault!

18:04.710 --> 18:07.680
It's your weak, fragile heart that is at fault.

18:09.080 --> 18:13.210
The weakness of your heart has
caused all your misfortune.

18:14.660 --> 18:18.110
My weak, fragile heart?

18:19.490 --> 18:23.460
Absolute Law breeds a strong heart,

18:23.460 --> 18:26.430
and makes it possible to control your power.

18:27.700 --> 18:30.270
But I...

18:30.270 --> 18:34.440
Noah, I will guide you.

18:34.440 --> 18:37.280
You don't have to be afraid alone anymore.

18:37.280 --> 18:39.710
You don't have to grieve.

18:39.710 --> 18:43.180
Entrust everything to me.

18:43.180 --> 18:44.990
Everything...

18:44.990 --> 18:47.450
Yes, everything.

19:07.570 --> 19:08.780
I am sorry.

19:08.780 --> 19:12.610
In the end, we have involved you in our battling.

19:12.610 --> 19:15.150
Oh, no, it's okay...

19:15.150 --> 19:18.820
But please, you mustn't push yourselves too far.

19:18.820 --> 19:23.460
I have not yet given up on a peaceful path.

19:23.460 --> 19:25.430
All right, I'll be going.

19:25.930 --> 19:26.930
Zed!

19:26.930 --> 19:28.300
Yeah?

19:28.300 --> 19:30.860
Be careful, okay?

19:30.860 --> 19:31.930
Right...

19:31.930 --> 19:34.400
And you take care of things here, Roya.

19:42.380 --> 19:44.170
Forward!

20:21.050 --> 20:22.620
There's so many of them!

20:22.620 --> 20:24.740
We won't be able to hold them off alone.

20:28.160 --> 20:29.780
Uh oh!

20:32.690 --> 20:34.830
There are so many soldiers!

20:34.830 --> 20:35.830
What should we do?

20:35.830 --> 20:37.800
We can't hold them all off!

20:38.630 --> 20:40.430
Damn it, move!

20:40.800 --> 20:42.770
You're in my way!

20:47.210 --> 20:49.000
How could you?!

21:17.600 --> 21:19.730
Stop it! Stop, I say!

21:20.210 --> 21:22.680
What? What is this?

21:22.680 --> 21:24.680
What is this sound?

21:24.680 --> 21:26.250
Cut it out!

21:26.250 --> 21:27.750
It's eerie!

21:27.750 --> 21:29.380
Stop it!

21:32.150 --> 21:33.920
It's God...

21:33.920 --> 21:36.390
God is awakening.

22:03.920 --> 22:05.890
What is that?!

22:25.110 --> 22:27.070
So, you finally show yourself.

22:41.920 --> 22:44.520
Open the hands you have over your face

22:44.520 --> 22:47.360
It looks like you'll be done in by the sun

22:47.360 --> 22:52.320
Let's let the sky melt away our melancholy

22:52.670 --> 22:58.310
We stripped off our heavy jackets
and started running, 6, 7, 8

22:58.310 --> 23:04.270
So, we'll make the wind blow in this
windless place, and take off! Go!

23:09.320 --> 23:14.720
I'm shaken awake, head spinning,
and sunlight hits me the next moment

23:14.720 --> 23:18.520
The rain's abatement lets loose dreams

23:20.230 --> 23:22.960
We'll dash down this path

23:22.960 --> 23:30.430
Search for the one-and-only "now"
and our heartbeats

23:31.100 --> 23:33.770
Thrust out our clasped hands

23:33.770 --> 23:36.540
It looks like we could even shatter the sun

23:36.540 --> 23:41.500
Let's launch our melancholy into the sky

23:42.020 --> 23:47.550
Try again, step forward, if we're hesitating 7, 8, 9

23:47.550 --> 23:53.690
We'll shout loud enough to echo
to Cloud Ten, and go!

24:16.980 --> 24:20.940
Next Time
The Prayer That Will Not Fade

24:17.920 --> 24:20.940


Next time, "The Prayer That Will Not Fade"
